  <TXWC_WarcasketShoulders_Toxin.comps.CompJetNozzle.jetLabel>噴射毒氣</TXWC_WarcasketShoulders_Toxin.comps.CompJetNozzle.jetLabel>
  <!-- EN: Spray a cone of tox gas from the shoulders toward the target. The gas lands in the inner cone and drifts over the outer area, thinning as it goes. Each jet draws on the warcasket's tank. Without a tank, the shoulders fall back on jets of their own, reloaded with chemfuel. -->
  <TXWC_WarcasketShoulders_Toxin.comps.CompJetNozzle.jetDescription>從護肩朝目標噴出錐形的毒氣。毒氣落在內側錐形，再向外圍飄散，越飄越稀。每次噴射都會消耗戰棺毒氣罐的存量。沒有毒氣罐時，護肩改用自身的噴射，以化合燃料裝填。</TXWC_WarcasketShoulders_Toxin.comps.CompJetNozzle.jetDescription>
